{"seq":4,"slug":"cosmology","title":"宇宙学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"宇宙学\">宇宙学</h1><p>宇宙学（Cosmology）是研究宇宙整体结构、起源、演化与最终命运的物理学分支。它以广义相对论为理论基础，结合粒子物理学与天文观测，构建描述宇宙从大爆炸到今天加速膨胀的完整图景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心内容\">核心内容</h2><p>本 Hub 涵盖现代宇宙学的四大支柱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宇宙学框架</td>\n<td>Friedmann 方程、Hubble 膨胀、ΛCDM 模型</td>\n<td>宇宙如何膨胀？标准模型如何描述宇宙？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早期宇宙</td>\n<td>大爆炸核合成、暴胀、CMB 物理</td>\n<td>宇宙最初几分钟发生了什么？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗宇宙</td>\n<td>暗物质、暗能量、修改引力</td>\n<td>宇宙 95% 的成分是什么？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前沿问题</td>\n<td>Hubble 张力、原初引力波、多宇宙</td>\n<td>标准模型面临哪些挑战？</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[宇宙学框架] --&gt; B[早期宇宙]&#10;    B --&gt; C[暗宇宙]&#10;    C --&gt; D[前沿问题]&#10;    A --&gt; C\">graph LR\n    A[宇宙学框架] --&gt; B[早期宇宙]\n    B --&gt; C[暗宇宙]\n    C --&gt; D[前沿问题]\n    A --&gt; C</pre><p>建议先掌握 Friedmann 方程与 ΛCDM 模型的基本框架，再深入早期宇宙物理过程，然后探索暗物质与暗能量的本质，最后关注当前未解决的前沿问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>广义相对论基础（度规、Einstein 场方程）</li>\n<li>热力学与统计物理</li>\n<li>粒子物理标准模型基础</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cosmological-framework","title":"宇宙学框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"friedmann-equations","title":"弗里德曼方程与宇宙动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework/friedmann-equations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cosmic-expansion-hubble","title":"宇宙膨胀与哈勃常数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework/cosmic-expansion-hubble"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lambda-cdm-model","title":"ΛCDM 标准模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/cosmological-framework/lambda-cdm-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-universe","title":"早期宇宙","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/early-universe","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"big-bang-nucleosynthesis","title":"大爆炸核合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/early-universe/big-bang-nucleosynthesis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cosmic-inflation","title":"宇宙暴胀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/early-universe/cosmic-inflation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cmb-physics","title":"宇宙微波背景辐射物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/early-universe/cmb-physics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dark-universe","title":"暗宇宙","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/dark-universe","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dark-matter-candidates","title":"暗物质候选粒子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/dark-universe/dark-matter-candidates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dark-energy-models","title":"暗能量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/dark-universe/dark-energy-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modified-gravity-theories","title":"修改引力理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/dark-universe/modified-gravity-theories"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers-cosmology","title":"宇宙学前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/frontiers-cosmology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hubble-tension","title":"哈勃常数张力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/frontiers-cosmology/hubble-tension"},{"seq":2,"slug":"primordial-gravitational-waves","title":"原初引力波","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/frontiers-cosmology/primordial-gravitational-waves"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multiverse-hypothesis","title":"多宇宙假说","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/cosmology/frontiers-cosmology/multiverse-hypothesis"}]}]}